WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.189 --> 00:00:02.239
- I feel like it's not
good for my insides.

00:00:02.239 --> 00:00:05.112
(upbeat cheerful music)

00:00:05.112 --> 00:00:06.113
- I love Peeps.

00:00:06.113 --> 00:00:06.968
- Peeps are dope.

00:00:06.968 --> 00:00:11.135
- I just think food
combinations are weird and fun.

00:00:12.368 --> 00:00:13.273
- Peepsa.

00:00:13.273 --> 00:00:14.231
(man laughs)

00:00:14.231 --> 00:00:15.481
- Who's doing this, the teens?

00:00:15.481 --> 00:00:17.419
- The dye's seeping into the pizza.

00:00:17.419 --> 00:00:19.919
- Look at this colorful pizza.

00:00:23.991 --> 00:00:24.995
- [Woman In Denim] It's pretty good.

00:00:24.995 --> 00:00:26.488
- It's so weird.

00:00:26.488 --> 00:00:27.769
- I like it.

00:00:27.769 --> 00:00:29.599
It tastes like pineapples on pizza.

00:00:29.599 --> 00:00:33.120
It's like a little sweet
on top of a little savory.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:34.204
- It's really good.

00:00:34.204 --> 00:00:35.659
(both laugh)

00:00:35.659 --> 00:00:37.924
- If I was smoking a blunt right now,

00:00:37.924 --> 00:00:42.091
it would be the best
pizza I ever had (laughs).

00:00:43.326 --> 00:00:44.532
- Chicken wings?

00:00:44.532 --> 00:00:46.446
- Is this, no, no.

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:47.876
I don't want to (laughs).

00:00:47.876 --> 00:00:48.834
- Should we cheers it?

00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:50.473
- Yeah, cheers.

00:00:50.473 --> 00:00:53.111
You know what, this is not bad though.

00:00:53.111 --> 00:00:53.944
- No.
- No.

00:00:54.823 --> 00:00:55.739
- No thank you.

00:00:55.739 --> 00:00:57.007
This isn't very good.
(woman in green laughs)

00:00:57.007 --> 00:00:58.558
- This tastes like chicken.
- It just tastes like chicken.

00:00:58.558 --> 00:00:59.769
- As does everything, right?

00:00:59.769 --> 00:01:00.989
- This is bad chicken wings.

00:01:00.989 --> 00:01:03.051
I don't wanna blame the Peeps for this.

00:01:03.051 --> 00:01:04.241
This is not the Peeps' fault.

00:01:04.241 --> 00:01:07.556
- There's no other way to
describe it besides fleshy.

00:01:07.556 --> 00:01:10.306
- We're ruining Easter, you guys.

00:01:11.870 --> 00:01:12.703
- Ew.
- Ew.

00:01:12.703 --> 00:01:13.542
(laughs)

00:01:13.542 --> 00:01:14.598
- Oh, oh.

00:01:14.598 --> 00:01:16.053
What is that?
- I knew I smelled pickles.

00:01:16.053 --> 00:01:17.499
- Yeah, I don't eat pickles.

00:01:17.499 --> 00:01:18.662
Ain't even gonna happen.

00:01:18.662 --> 00:01:19.708
- I love pickles.

00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:21.274
- I love pickles too and I love Peeps,

00:01:21.274 --> 00:01:23.524
so maybe this won't be the worst.

00:01:23.524 --> 00:01:25.712
- This is a terrible life choice.

00:01:25.712 --> 00:01:28.129
(man groans)

00:01:29.741 --> 00:01:31.805
- This would be good if
you were drunk or high.

00:01:31.805 --> 00:01:33.828
- Well, anything's good
when you're drunk and high.

00:01:33.828 --> 00:01:35.971
- Oh, I don't think I can do it.

00:01:35.971 --> 00:01:36.976
- It's not that bad.

00:01:36.976 --> 00:01:38.123
- Do we have a spit can?

00:01:38.123 --> 00:01:39.956
- Did anyone throw up?

00:01:41.013 --> 00:01:44.061
- I think a Peep is a really
good thing on its own,

00:01:44.061 --> 00:01:45.353
but if you try to put it with

00:01:45.353 --> 00:01:47.304
other things, it's really risky.

00:01:47.304 --> 00:01:48.908
- Turns out Peeps are the tofu of candy.

00:01:48.908 --> 00:01:50.370
You can do anything to
them and make it taste

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:52.757
like whatever you want if
you just try hard enough.

00:01:52.757 --> 00:01:54.066
- What I will say about Peeps is that

00:01:54.066 --> 00:01:55.235
no matter what you put it on,

00:01:55.235 --> 00:01:58.373
they still really make it not awful.

00:01:58.373 --> 00:02:00.394
There's nothing with a
Peep that's that bad.

00:02:00.394 --> 00:02:02.477
But don't challenge them.

